      }
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "es": "El match se jugó en The College, en el barrio londinense de Holborn.",
        "en": "The match was played at The College in London's Holborn district."
      },
      "source": {
        "label": "Wikipedia",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Chess_Championship_2018"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "es": "En ritmo clásico, Carlsen y Caruana estaban separados por solo 3 puntos de rating; en partidas rápidas, la diferencia era de 91 puntos a favor de Carlsen.",
        "en": "In classical chess Carlsen and Caruana were just 3 rating points apart; in rapid chess the gap was 91 points in Carlsen's favour."
      },
      "source": {
        "label": "Wikipedia",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Chess_Championship_2018"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "es": "Con este triunfo, Carlsen se convirtió en campeón mundial por cuarta vez.",
        "en": "With this win Carlsen became world champion for the fourth time."
      },
      "source": {
        "label": "Wikipedia",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_Chess_Championship_2018"
      }
